AUDIO: 'Hey guys, Today we\'re announcing the effect generator node. Effect generator node basically lets you&nbsp; vibe code any node with a custom effect. You can type in what you want and&nbsp; it will build the node for you. For example, you can create a focus blur node. It will take the source video and the depth&nbsp; map and you can move the focus point around it.'

